Read `AGENTS.md` first. It is the project index and its golden rules apply to every change.

- Team rules: `.claude/rules/*.md` (plain Markdown, they apply to every tool, not only Claude).
- Facts: `docs/context/` - open only the file the task needs.
- Shared agent state, hand-off, bugs and message log: `.agents/` (see `.agents/README.md`).
- Skills (step-by-step procedures): `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` when exported - read the matching one before that kind of task.
- Before saying done: `docs/context/SELF_REVIEW.md` and `docs/context/DEFINITION_OF_DONE.md`.
